OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1785383016
OL,3,CMother and boyfriend guilty of
OL,4,Cmurdering toddler
OL,6,FA mother and her new boyfriend have
OL,7,Fbeen convicted of murdering her two-
OL,8,Fyear-old daughter, who was sexually
OL,9,Fabused before she suffered a
OL,10,Fcatastrophic head injury.
OL,12,FIsabelle Welsh suffered 21 broken
OL,13,Fbones in the weeks before she
OL,14,Fcollapsed at her home in Thornaby,
OL,15,FTeesside, last September.
OL,17,FHer mother, Alexandra Walker, 26, and
OL,18,FHarrison Simpson, 22, denied murder,
OL,19,Fallowing the death of a child, sexual
OL,20,Fassault and child cruelty.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G1/3
