OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1785383016
OL,3,CMother and boyfriend guilty of
OL,4,Cmurdering toddler
OL,6,FAfter almost seven hours of
OL,7,Fdeliberations, a jury at Teesside
OL,8,FCrown Court convicted Simpson
OL,9,Funanimously, and Walker by a majority
OL,10,Fof 11 to one, of murder.
OL,12,FThey also convicted the pair of child
OL,13,Fcruelty.
OL,15,FSimpson was convicted of sexual
OL,16,Fassault on the toddler, while Walker
OL,17,Fwas cleared of that charge.
OL,19,FMs Justice Norton thanked the jury for
OL,20,Ftheir work on such a "difficult" case.
OL,26,@|D@VOU|D@`O]
